---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import Code from "../../assets/images/cover/code.webp";
import GithubIcon from "./icons/GithubIcon.astro";
import LinkedinIcon from "./icons/LinkedinIcon.astro";
---

<section
  class="h-full flex flex-col justify-center items-center gap-12 text-yellow-50 md:gap-8 md:flex-1 md:flex-row md:justify-center 2xl:py-40"
>
  <div
    class="flex flex-col justify-center items-center gap-y-4 px-8 md:gap-y-10 md:items-start md:p-0"
  >
    <!-- Laptop/Desktop -->
    <div class="hidden text-4xl font-semi md:flex flex-row gap-x-4">
      <h1 class="text-orange-300">Jesús Quiñones</h1>
      <span>|</span>
      <h2 class="text-rose-300">Desarrollador Web</h2>
    </div>
    <!-- Mobile -->
    <div class="md:hidden flex flex-col gap-4">
      <h1 class="block text-center text-2xl font-semibold">
        ¡Hola!👋🏻<span class="block">Soy Jesús Quiñones</span>
      </h1>
      <h2 class="block text-center text-3xl text-orange-400 font-semibold">
        Desarrollador Web
      </h2>
    </div>
    <article class="text-xl text-center md:text-left md:font-normal leading-6">
      <p>Creo aplicaciones web utilizando un stack tecnológico</p>
      <p>
        orientado a <span class="font-bold text-yellow-500">javascript</span> y algo
        de <span class="text-sky-600 font-bold">python</span>.
      </p>
      <p class="text-white">
        De <span class="text-indigo-300">Lecheria</span>, <span
          class="text-rose-500 text-bold">Venezuela</span
        >.
      </p>
    </article>
    <nav aria-label="Redes sociales" class="flex flex-row items-center gap-x-6">
      <a
        href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/sugabdev/"
        class="hover:scale-120 transition"
        aria-label="Linked in logo to redirect to my linkedin profile"
      >
        <LinkedinIcon class="size-12 md:size-16" />
      </a>
      <a
        href="https://github.com/Sugabdev"
        class="hover:scale-120 transition"
        aria-label="Github logo to redirect to my Github profile"
      >
        <GithubIcon class="size-12 md:size-16" />
      </a>
    </nav>
  </div>
  <Image
    src={Code}
    alt="Imágen principal"
    loading="eager"
    class="rounded-md w-xs md:w-xl opacity-80 shadow-2xl shadow-pink-400"
  />
</section>
